================================================================================
3) THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
================================================================================

Some questions reference public-domain content from official sources, e.g.:
  - DGUV (Deutsche Gesetzliche Unfallversicherung) – Vorschriften and Regeln
    are official works of German legal nature and not subject to copyright
    (UrhG § 5).
  - DIN VDE / VDE-AR norms – text quotations and references are used under
    fair-use citation rights; original norms remain copyrighted by their
    publishers (Beuth Verlag / VDE Verlag).

Question wording, distractors and explanations were independently authored
to avoid copying protected formulations from commercial sources.

